{
  "name": "@aikit/cache",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Zero-dep, type-safe LLM response cache for Node.js, Bun, Deno, browsers, and edge runtimes (Cloudflare Workers, Vercel Edge). Exact-match + optional semantic cache via pluggable embeddings, in-flight single-flight coalescing (with optional distributed lock for multi-pod deployments), per-model TTL, streaming-aware replay, programmatic invalidation by key/prefix/tag, dollar-denominated savings tracker. Pluggable storage (in-memory LRU / Redis / Upstash / Cloudflare KV / Vercel KV / SQLite / Postgres+pgvector). Drop-in adapters for OpenAI, Anthropic, Vercel AI SDK, LangChain.js, Hono, Express, Next.js. Open-source alternative to Helicone / Portkey / Redis LangCache without LangChain coupling.",
